<div class="phead"><div class="w"><ol class="crumbs"><li><a href="{{ PathBase }}/">Gablefen Realty</a></li><li>Sell with us</li></ol><p class="kick">Selling in Gablefen</p><h1>A card in the window, and a pin on the plat</h1><p class="lede">When we take a listing, it gets a card in the bay window, a pin on the town plat, an elevation drawn from the house itself, and a place on the open-house board if you want one.</p></div></div><section class="sec tight"><div class="w"><div class="prose" style="max-width:70ch"><p>Rowan and Evan handle most of the seller work. We will walk the house, look at what has actually sold on your street, and agree a price before anything hangs in the window.</p><p>The public sheet is this site: the elevation, the floor plan, the facts and the open-house hours. Private remarks stay on the agent desk, behind sign-in. Offers come in by email or on paper at the office, not through a form.</p></div><div class="card" style="margin-top:28px;max-width:70ch"><p class="kick">Talk to someone</p><p style="margin:0">Call the office at (555) 014-1860, or Rowan Ellison directly. We do not take listing agreements through this website.</p></div></div></section>
